*> PLB-Q016 cursor-open-twice: an SQL cursor opened again with no
*> CLOSE between.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. OPENTWO.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-ID                   PIC S9(9) COMP.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE ACCT-CUR CURSOR FOR
        SELECT ACCT_ID FROM ACCOUNT
    END-EXEC.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE CUST-CUR CURSOR FOR
        SELECT CUST_ID FROM CUSTOMER
    END-EXEC.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    *> Reported: in the same list, and in a later sentence.
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    MOVE 0 TO WS-ID
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC.
    EXEC SQL CLOSE ACCT-CUR END-EXEC.
    EXEC SQL OPEN CUST-CUR END-EXEC.
    DISPLAY WS-ID.
    EXEC SQL OPEN CUST-CUR END-EXEC.
    *> Not reported: closed between, SQLCODE tested between, a PERFORM
    *> between, and another cursor.
    EXEC SQL CLOSE CUST-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL CLOSE ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    IF SQLCODE NOT = 0
        EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    END-IF
    EXEC SQL CLOSE ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    PERFORM CLOSE-ACCT
    EXEC SQL OPEN ACCT-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL OPEN CUST-CUR END-EXEC
    STOP RUN.
CLOSE-ACCT.
    EXEC SQL CLOSE ACCT-CUR END-EXEC.
